 API.","why":"Interop with pandas/datasets via fsspec; buckets API was added AI-assisted.","paths":["src/huggingface_hub/hf_file_system.py","src/huggingface_hub/_buckets.py","src/huggingface_hub/_bucket_live_follow.py","src/huggingface_hub/_hot_reload"],"centrality":3,"clusters":["C6"],"scope":"architectural","history":[{"sha":"c837937","date":"2026-02-19","klass":"human","agent":null,"author":"Charles","subject":"feat(spaces): hot-reload (#3776)"},{"sha":"eaac6fe","date":"2026-02-24","klass":"assisted","agent":"cursor","author":"Lucain","subject":"Buckets API (#3673)"}],"importance":0.413,"orientation":{"purpose":"Gives Hub repos and buckets a file-system interface (fsspec) that tools like pandas and datasets can use. It also holds bucket live-following and Spaces hot-reload.","decision":"A POSIX-like fsspec filesystem, with Buckets as a separate Xet-backed storage type. Plain download and upload helpers or a custom file API were not chosen. fsspec gives interoperability with the data ecosystem.","where":[{"path":"src/huggingface_hub/hf_file_system.py","what":"HfFileSystem implementation"},{"path":"src/huggingface_hub/_buckets.py","what":"bucket types and operations"},{"path":"src/huggingface_hub/_hot_reload","what":"Spaces hot-reload code"}],"shaped_by":"Charles wrote hot-reload in Feb 2026 [human]; Lucain's Buckets API that month was [assisted] with Cursor.","basis":"5200ea6f4f32","head":"2c61ae8c11eedb1b79e262dd9eb5e68962cac063","generated_at":"2026-11-15T07:29:34+00:00"}},{"id":"repocard-mixin","name":"Repo cards and ModelHubMixin","kind":"module","summary":"Model/dataset card parsing and metadata plus the mixin that gives ML framework classes save/push/from_pretrained.","decision":"YAML front-matter cards with jinja templates; ModelHubMixin with safetensors by default for PyTorch.","alternatives":"Framework-specific integrations; pickle weights.","why":"Downstream library integration and security of safetensors.","paths":["src/huggingface_hub/repocard.py","src